  "description": "Official .NET client for PWF Auth (pwfauth.com): license-key activation, hardware-ID binding, encrypted sessions with a server-driven kill switch, free trials, remote texts/slides, and OTA update checks. Speaks the AES-256-CBC + HMAC-SHA256 envelope protocol so you never hand-roll crypto. Works on .NET Framework 4.6.2+ and .NET 5+.",
