  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- A request that gets no reply at all (no connection, DNS, a firewall, a proxy, TLS) now throws PwfHttpException with StatusCode 0 and the network error as InnerException, as documented. 1.3.0 let the raw HttpRequestException through.\n- LogoutAsync returns null when the server cannot be reached, as documented, instead of throwing.\n- A connection that drops while the reply is read is a PwfHttpException too.\n- User-Agent: PWFAuth-dotnet/1.3.1 (+https://pwfauth.com).\nFull history: https://github.com/pwfauth/pwfauth-dotnet/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
